OL,3,GNEWSAEvacuated flat residents will not
OL,4,Abe home for Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents who were evacuated from a
OL,7,FKent tower block in May due to flooding
OL,8,Fthat cut off power have been told they
OL,9,Fwill not be able to return before the
OL,10,Fend of 2026.
OL,12,FAn additional flood at Miller Heights
OL,13,Fin Maidstone on 9 October has damaged
OL,14,Fnew electrical equipment causing power
OL,15,Fto remain off and a "further setback in
OL,16,Fthe recovery," building managers
OL,17,FCentrick told residents in a letter.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
