OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAEvacuated flat residents will not
OL,4,Abe home for Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FMichael Alexander, whose wife is a
OL,7,Fleaseholder at the property, said
OL,8,Fresidents were feeling outrage at
OL,9,F"anyone who's been involved in this
OL,10,Fproject".
OL,12,FIn a statement, Centrick said: "We
OL,13,Frecognise the significant impact the
OL,14,Fongoing situation at Miller Heights
OL,15,Fcontinues to have on residents and
OL,16,Ftheir families."
